瀹氱粨鏋勭殑JSON銆�\\n必须只输出一个 JSON 对象，且包含 issues 数组；无问题时返回 {\\"issues\\":[]}。issues 元素字段：title,severity(HIGH|MEDIUM|LOW|INFO),startLine,endLine,evidence,description,suggestion。title、description（问题说明）、suggestion（整改建议）必须使用简体中文，禁止英文段落；evidence 可保留代码原文。\\n\\n【输出格式强制要求】你必须只输出一个 JSON 对象，禁止输出 Markdown/解释文字。顶层必须包含 issues 数组；无问题时返回 {\\"issues\\":[]}。issues 每个元素字段：title(string), severity(HIGH|MEDIUM|LOW|INFO), startLine(number), endLine(number), evidence(string), description(string), suggestion(string)。【语言强制要求】title、description（问题说明）、suggestion（整改建议）必须使用简体中文撰写，禁止英文段落；evidence 可保留原文代码片段。示例：{\\"issues\\":[{\\"title\\":\\"示例问题\\",\\"severity\\":\\"HIGH\\",\\"startLine\\":1,\\"endLine\\":1,\\"evidence\\":\\"代码片段\\",\\"description\\":\\"问题说明必须用中文\\",\\"suggestion\\":\\"整改建议必须用中文\\"}]}"},{"role":"user","content":"检查规则：\\n查询项目文件，找到多表联查的sql，判断这些sql文件是否关联查询大于2张表的\\n文件：X001-userpermissions/src/main/resources/mapper/OtherPlatformCorpMapper.xml\\n内容：\\n<?xml version=\\"1.0\\" encoding=\\"UTF-8\\"?>\\r\\n<!DOCTYPE mapper PUBLIC \\"-//mybatis.org//DTD Mapper 3.0//EN\\" \\"http://mybatis.org/dtd/mybatis-3-mapper.dtd\\">\\r\\n<mapper namespace=\\"xyy.base.mapper.OtherPlatformCorpMapper\\">\\r\\n  <resultMap id=\\"BaseResultMap\\" type=\\"xyy.base.entity.OtherPlatformCorpEntity\\">\\r\\n    <id column=\\"id\\" jdbcType=\\"INTEGER\\" property=\\"id\\" />\\r\\n    <result column=\\"system_code\\" jdbcType=\\"VARCHAR\\" property=\\"systemCode\\" />\\r\\n    <result column=\\"corp_id\\" jdbcType=\\"VARCHAR\\" property=\\"corpId\\" />\\r\\n    <result column=\\"tenant_id\\" jdbcType=\\"VARCHAR\\" property=\\"tenantId\\" />\\r\\n    <result column=\\"corp_name\\" jdbcType=\\"VARCHAR\\" property=\\"corpName\\" />\\r\\n    <result column=\\"corp_province\\" jdbcType=\\"VARCHAR\\" property=\\"corpProvince\\" />\\r\\n    <result column=\\"corp_city\\" jdbcType=\\"VARCHAR\\" property=\\"corpCity\\" />\\r\\n    <result column=\\"user_id\\" jdbcType=\\"VARCHAR\\" property=\\"userId\\" />\\r\\n    <result column=\\"auth_state\\" jdbcType=\\"BIT\\" property=\\"authState\\" />\\r\\n    <result column=\\"create_time\\" jdbcType=\\"TIMESTAMP\\" property=\\"createTime\\" />\\r\\n    <result column=\\"admin_account\\" jdbcType=\\"VARCHAR\\" property=\\"adminAccount\\" />\\r\\n    <result column=\\"package_standard_id\\" jdbcType=\\"INTEGER\\" property=\\"packageStandardId\\" />\\r\\n    <result column=\\"start_time\\" jdbcType=\\"TIMESTAMP\\" property=\\"startTime\\" />\\r\\n    <result column=\\"end_time\\" jdbcType=\\"TIMESTAMP\\" property=\\"endTime\\" />\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n    <result column=\\"platformName\\" jdbcType=\\"VARCHAR\\" property=\\"platformName\\" />\\r\\n  </resultMap>\\r\\n  <sql id=\\"Base_Column_List\\">\\r\\n    id, system_code, corp_id, tenant_id, corp_name, corp_province, corp_city, user_id, \\r\\n    auth_state, create_time, admin_account, package_standard_id, start_time, end_time\\r\\n  </sql>\\r\\n  <select id=\\"selectByTenantId\\" resultMap=\\"BaseResultMap\\">\\r\\n      SELECT\\r\\n      opc.tenant_id, pi.platform_name as platformName\\r\\n      FROM other_platform_corp as opc\\r\\n      LEFT JOIN platform_standard as ps on ps.id = opc.package_standard_id\\r\\n      LEFT JOIN platform_identification as pi on pi.platform_sign = ps.platform_sign\\r\\n      <where>\\r\\n          opc.tenant_id in\\r\\n          <foreach collection=\\"tenantIds\\" open=\\"(\\" separator=\\",\\" close=\\")\\" item=\\"item\\">#{item}</foreach>\\r\\n      </where>\\r\\n  </select>\\r\\n\\r\\n    <select id=\\"selectByTenantIds\\" resultMap=\\"BaseResultMap\\">\\r\\n        SELECT\\r\\n        opc.tenant_id,opc.system_code, pi.platform_name as platformName\\r\\n        FROM other_platform_corp as opc\\r\\n        LEFT JOIN platform_standard as ps on ps.id = opc.package_standard_id\\r\\n        LEFT JOIN platform_identification as pi on pi.platform_sign = ps.platform_sign\\r\\n        <where>\\r\\n            opc.tenant_id in\\r\\n            <foreach collection=\\"tenantIds\\