le":"user","content":"【检查规则】\\n查询项目文件，找到多表联查的sql，判断这些sql文件是否关联查询大于2张表的\\n\\n【文件】X001-userpermissions/src/main/resources/mapper/CompanyAccountMapper.xml\\n【说明】以下代码每一行格式为 \\"行号|原文\\"；issues 的 startLine/endLine 必须严格对应左侧行号，禁止估算。\\n```xml\\n1|<?xml version=\\"1.0\\" encoding=\\"UTF-8\\"?>\\n2|<!DOCTYPE mapper PUBLIC \\"-//mybatis.org//DTD Mapper 3.0//EN\\" \\"http://mybatis.org/dtd/mybatis-3-mapper.dtd\\">\\n3|<mapper namespace=\\"xyy.base.mapper.CompanyAccountMapper\\">\\n4|\\n5|    <resultMap id=\\"BaseResultMap\\" type=\\"xyy.base.entity.CompanyAccountEntity\\">\\n6|        <!--@Table company_account-->\\n7|        <result property=\\"id\\" column=\\"id\\" jdbcType=\\"INTEGER\\"/>\\n8|        <result property=\\"companyCode\\" column=\\"company_code\\" jdbcType=\\"VARCHAR\\"/>\\n9|        <result property=\\"companyName\\" column=\\"company_name\\" jdbcType=\\"VARCHAR\\"/>\\n10|        <result property=\\"account\\" column=\\"account\\" jdbcType=\\"VARCHAR\\"/>\\n11|        <result property=\\"tenantId\\" column=\\"tenant_id\\" jdbcType=\\"VARCHAR\\"/>\\n12|        <result property=\\"systemCode\\" column=\\"system_code\\" jdbcType=\\"VARCHAR\\"/>\\n13|        <result property=\\"enabled\\" column=\\"enabled\\" jdbcType=\\"BOOLEAN\\"/>\\n14|        <result property=\\"email\\" column=\\"email\\" jdbcType=\\"VARCHAR\\"/>\\n15|        <result property=\\"userType\\" column=\\"user_type\\" jdbcType=\\"BOOLEAN\\"/>\\n16|        <result property=\\"accountId\\" column=\\"accountId\\" jdbcType=\\"INTEGER\\"/>\\n17|        <result column=\\"userId\\" jdbcType=\\"VARCHAR\\" property=\\"userId\\" />\\n18|        <result column=\\"realName\\" jdbcType=\\"VARCHAR\\" property=\\"realName\\" />\\n19|        <result column=\\"organizeName\\" jdbcType=\\"VARCHAR\\" property=\\"organizeName\\" />\\n20|        <result column=\\"createTime\\" jdbcType=\\"VARCHAR\\" property=\\"createTime\\" />\\n21|        <result column=\\"enabledMark\\" property=\\"enabledMark\\" jdbcType=\\"INTEGER\\"/>\\n22|    </resultMap>\\n23|\\n24|\\n25|    <select id=\\"queryListUserPlatform\\" resultType=\\"xyy.base.entity.CompanyAdminEntity\\">\\n26|        SELECT\\n27|        ca.id,\\n28|        ca.account,\\n29|        ca.admin_name,\\n30|        ca.company_name,\\n31|        ca.company_code,\\n32|        ca.tenant_id,\\n33|        ca.tenant_photo,\\n34|        ca.create_time,\\n35|        ca.update_time,\\n36|        ca.status,\\n37|        ca.be_logoff,\\n38|        ca.system_code,\\n39|        ca.email,\\n40|        ca.corp_province,\\n41|        ca.corp_city,\\n42|        bu.real_name as realName,\\n43|        ca.company_name as organizeName,\\n44|        bu.enabled_mark as enabledMark,\\n45|        bu.creator_time as createTime,\\n46|        bu.id as userId\\n47|        FROM  base_user AS bu\\n48|        LEFT JOIN company_admin AS ca ON ca.tenant_id = bu.tenant_id\\n49|        <where>\\n50|            <if test=\\"tenantId != null and tenantId != ''''\\">and ca.tenant_id like concat(#{tenantId},''%'')</if>\\n51|            <if test=\\"realName != null and realName != ''''\\">and bu.real_name like concat(#{realName},''%'')</if>\\n52|            <if test=\\"organizeName != null and organizeName != ''''\\">and ca.company_name like concat(#{organizeName},''%'')</if>\\n53|            <if test=\\"account != null and account != ''''\\">and bu.account = #{account}</if>\\n54|            <if test=\\"systemCodeList.size() != 0 and systemCodeList!= null\\">\\n55|                and ca.system_code in\\n56|                <foreach collection=\\"systemCodeList\\" open=\\"(\\" separator=\\",\\" close=\\")\\" item=\\"item\\">\\n57|                    #{item}\\n58|                </foreach>\\n59|            </if>\\n60|        </where>\\n61|        ORDER BY bu.creator_time DESC\\n62|    </select>\\n63|\\n64|\\n65|    <select id=\\"getUserList\\" resultMap=\\"BaseResultMap\\">\\n66|        SELECT\\n67|        ca.id,\\n68|        ca.company_code,\\n69|        ca.company_name,\\n70|        bu.account,\\n71|        bu.tenant_id,\\n72|        ca.system_code,\\n73|        bu.enabled_mark AS enabled,\\n74|        bu.email,\\n75|        bu.user_type,\\n76|        bu.id AS accountId,\\n77|        bu.id as userId,\\n78|        bu.real_name as realName,\\n79|        ca.company_name as organizeName,\\n80|        bu.creator_time as createTime,\\n81|        bu.enabled_mark as enabledMark\\n82|        FROM base_user AS bu\\n83|        LEFT JOIN company_admin AS ca ON ca.tenant_id = bu.tenant_id\\n84|        <where>\\n85|            <if test=\\"companyName != null and companyName != ''''\\">and ca.company_name = #{companyName}</if>\\n86|            <if test=\\"realName != null and realName != ''''\\">and bu.real_name= #{realName}</if>\\n87|            <if test=\\"tenantIdList.size() != 0 and tenantIdList!= null\\">\\n88|                and ca.tenant_id in\\n89|                <foreach collection=\\"tenantIdList\\" open=\\"(\\" separator=\\",\\" close=\\")\\" item=\\"item\\">\\n90|                    #{item}\\n91|                </foreach>\\n92|            </if>\\n93|        </where>\\n94|        ORDER BY bu.creator_time DESC\\n95|    </select>\\n96|\\n97|</mapper>\\n98|\\n99|\\n```"}],"temperature":0,"response_format":{"type":"json_object"}},"rawResponse":{"id":"76189dc7-cf07-48be-ba63-f8edb20c306a","object":"chat.completion","created":1786589331,"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\\"issues\\":[]}","reasoning_content":"我们需要检查规则：找出多表联查的sql，判断这些sql文件是否关联查询大于2张表。用户提供的文件是 CompanyAccountMapper.xml。我们需要检查文件中的SQL，看是否有SELECT语句关联了超过2张表。文件包含两个select：queryListUserPlatform和getUserList。我们分析每个select涉及的表的数量。\\n\\n首先，查询规则：多表联查的sql，判断是否关联查询大于2张表。也就是说，对于每个SQL，计算JOIN的表数量。如果FROM子句或JOIN中出现的表数量大于2（即至少3张表），则认为是问题。注意：可能包括子查询等，但这里简单看。\\n\\n查看第一个select queryListUserPlatform：\\n- FROM base_user AS bu\\n- LEFT JOIN company_admin AS ca ON ca.tenant_id = bu.tenant_id\\n所以涉及的表：base_user 和 company_admin。这是2张表。所以不大于2，即不大于2，等于2，没问题。\\n\\n查看第二个select getUserList：\\n- FROM base_user AS bu\\n- LEFT JOIN company_admin AS ca ON ca.tenant_id = bu.tenant_id\\n同样2张表。所以没问题。\\n\\n因此没有满足\\"关联查询大于2张表\\"的SQL。所以issues为空。\\n\\n但是注意：规则是\\"判断这些sql文件是否关联查询大于2张表的\\"可能意思是找出所有多表联查的SQL，然后判断是否关联表数超过2张。如果超过2张就有问题。这里都是2张，所以没问题。\\n\\n因此输出 {\\"issues\\":[]}。\\n\\n确认一下是否还有其他SQL？文件只有两个select。另外注意resultMap是映射，不是查询。所以没有。\\n\\n所以最终输出：{\\"issues\\":[]}\\n\\n注意格式：必须只输出JSON对象，没有markdown。\\n\\n就这样。"},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":1869,"completion_tokens":377,"total_tokens":2246,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":512},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":371},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":512,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":1357},"system_fingerprint":"fp_a18b46594c_prod0820_fp8_kvcache_20260402"}},{"stage":"AI_RESULT_UPDATE","systemChars":879,"userChars":4732,"requestChars":6068,"responseChars":14189,"costMs":32603,"usage":{"prompt_tokens":"1889","completion_tokens":"4895","total_tokens":"6784"},"content":{"issues":[{"title":"OGNL表达式空指针风险：systemCodeList未判空即调用size()","severity":"HIGH","startLine":54,"endLine":54,"evidence":"<if test=\\"systemCodeList.size() != 0 and systemCodeList!= null\\">","description":"在MyBatis的<if>测试中，条件顺序错误，当systemCodeList为null时，先执行size()会抛出空指针异常。","suggestion":"调整条件顺序为 ''systemCodeList != null and systemCodeList.size() != 0''，确保先判空。"},{"title":"OGNL表达式空指针风险：tenantIdList未判空即调用size()","severity":"HIGH","startLine":87,"endLine":87,"evidence":"<if test=\\"tenantIdList.size() != 0 and tenantIdList!= null\\">","description":"在MyBatis的<if>测试中，条件顺序错误，当tenantIdList为null时，先执行size()会抛出空指针异常。","suggestion":"调整条件顺序为 ''tenantIdList != null and tenantIdList.size() != 0''，确保先判空。"}]},"rawRequest":{"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"浣犳槸鎵弿缁撴灉鏁寸悊鍔╂墜銆傝鏍规嵁缁撴灉鏇存柊瑙勫垯鏁寸悊鍒濇闂锛屽彧杩斿洖绗﹀悎绾﹀畾缁撴瀯鐨凧SON銆�\\n必须只输出一个 JSON 对象，且包含 issues 数组；无问题时返回 {\\"issues\\":[]}。issues 元素字段：title,severity(HIGH|MEDIUM|LOW|INFO),startLine,endLine,evidence,description,suggestion。titl