\\":\\"整改建议必须用中文\\"}]}"},{"role":"user","content":"【检查规则】\\n扫描代码文件，看看哪些js方法没有被调用过\\n\\n【结果更新/整理要求】\\n记录文件名称，方法名称，和行号\\n\\n【文件】herolord9_disco-elysium-website/src/components/HeroBackground.vue\\n【说明】以下代码每一行格式为 \\"行号|原文\\"；issues 的 startLine/endLine 必须严格对应左侧行号，禁止估算。\\n```vue\\n1|<template>\\n2|  <div v-if=\\"shouldShowBackground\\" class=\\"hero-background\\" :style=\\"backgroundStyle\\"></div>\\n3|</template>\\n4|\\n5|<script setup lang=\\"ts\\">\\n6|import { computed, onMounted, onUnmounted } from ''vue''\\n7|import { useTheme } from ''../composables/useTheme''\\n8|\\n9|const { currentTheme } = useTheme()\\n10|\\n11|const shouldShowBackground = computed(() => {\\n12|  if (!currentTheme.value?.configJson) {\\n13|    console.log(''[HeroBackground] 没有 configJson'')\\n14|    return false\\n15|  }\\n16|  \\n17|  try {\\n18|    const config = typeof currentTheme.value.configJson === ''string'' \\n19|      ? JSON.parse(currentTheme.value.configJson) \\n20|      : currentTheme.value.configJson\\n21|    \\n22|    const result = config?.style?.backgrounds?.body?.type === ''image''\\n23|    console.log(''[HeroBackground] 是否显示背景:'', result)\\n24|    console.log(''[HeroBackground] 背景配置:'', config?.style?.backgrounds?.body)\\n25|    return result\\n26|  } catch (e) {\\n27|    console.error(''[HeroBackground] 解析配置失败:'', e)\\n28|    return false\\n29|  }\\n30|})\\n31|\\n32|const backgroundStyle = computed(() => {\\n33|  if (!currentTheme.value?.configJson) return {}\\n34|  \\n35|  try {\\n36|    const config = typeof currentTheme.value.configJson === ''string'' \\n37|      ? JSON.parse(currentTheme.value.configJson) \\n38|      : currentTheme.value.configJson\\n39|    \\n40|    const bg = config?.style?.backgrounds?.body || {}\\n41|    \\n42|    return {\\n43|      backgroundImage: bg.image ? `url(${bg.image})` : ''none'',\\n44|      backgroundAttachment: bg.attachment || ''fixed'',\\n45|      backgroundSize: bg.size || ''cover'',\\n46|      backgroundPosition: bg.position || ''top center'',\\n47|      backgroundRepeat: ''no-repeat'',\\n48|      filter: bg.blur ? `blur(${bg.blur})` : ''blur(0px)'',\\n49|      backgroundColor: bg.overlay || ''transparent''\\n50|    }\\n51|  } catch {\\n52|    return {}\\n53|  }\\n54|})\\n55|\\n56|// 当背景显示时，给 #app-root 添加类名\\n57|onMounted(() => {\\n58|  console.log(''[HeroBackground] 组件已挂载'')\\n59|  const appRoot = document.getElementById(''app-root'')\\n60|  console.log(''[HeroBackground] appRoot 元素:'', appRoot)\\n61|  console.log(''[HeroBackground] shouldShowBackground:'', shouldShowBackground.value)\\n62|  \\n63|  if (appRoot && shouldShowBackground.value) {\\n64|    appRoot.classList.add(''has-background-image'')\\n65|    console.log(''[HeroBackground] 已添加 has-background-image 类'')\\n66|  }\\n67|})\\n68|\\n69|onUnmounted(() => {\\n70|  const appRoot = document.getElementById(''app-root'')\\n71|  if (appRoot) {\\n72|    appRoot.classList.remove(''has-background-image'')\\n73|  }\\n74|})\\n75|</script>\\n76|\\n77|<style scoped>\\n78|.hero-background {\\n79|  position: fixed;\\n80|  top: 0;\\n81|  left: 0;\\n82|  width: 100%;\\n83|  height: 60vh; /* 只在 Hero 区域显示 */\\n84|  z-index: 0; /* 设置为 0，在 body 之上 */\\n85|  \\n86|  /* 防止虚化后边缘出现白边 */\\n87|  transform: scale(1.05);\\n88|  \\n89|  /* 背景混合模式 */\\n90|  background-blend-mode: overlay;\\n91|  \\n92|  /* 平滑过渡 */\\n93|  transition: opacity 0.3s ease;\\n94|}\\n95|</style>\\n96|\\n```"}],"temperature":0,"response_format":{"type":"json_object"}},"rawResponse":{"id":"1feccc5a-47a7-4d2f-8bf7-c58811af4622","object":"chat.completion","created":1786672238,"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\\"issues\\":[]}","reasoning_content":"我们只需要分析哪些js方法没有被调用。注意该文件是Vue组件，包含computed, onMounted等。检查代码，列出定义的方法和调用情况。可能的方法：computed里的箭头函数、onMounted、onUnmounted。另外还有console调用但不是定义的方法。我们需要识别定义的方法：比如shouldShowBackground computed, backgroundStyle computed, onMounted回调, onUnmounted回调。另外还有内部定义的函数？没有其他显式函数。该文件是组件，这些方法可能是生命周期钩子，由Vue框架调用，不应视为未调用